r($,"aQD","aBC",()=>{var q="A shop management app for rural agricultural sellers, featuring revolving fund tracking and organized sales records with printable invoices and shop branding.",p="For Farmers \u2014 Introducing the \u201cSu Buu\u201d App! Developed by Tun Yat, this app aims to improve farmers\u2019 livelihoods through mechanization services, agricultural technology training, capacity-building programs for women\u2019s empowerment, and market linkage initiatives.\nNow, Tun Yat proudly introduces the \u201cSu Buu\u201d mobile application \u2014 a one-stop digital platform where farmers, agribusiness owners, and agriculture enthusiasts can learn, explore, and purchase everything related to farming right from their phones.\nKey features of the Su Buu App include:\n\ud83d\udcb0 Finance: Learn how to prepare for agricultural loans, explore financing programs from institutions, and access the latest financial updates.\n\ud83d\udcca Market Information: Stay updated with real-time crop prices, market trends, and export/import news.\n\ud83c\udf31 Farming Techniques: Discover both traditional and modern Climate-Smart Agriculture methods and technologies.\n\ud83d\uded2 Online Marketplace (E-commerce): Browse and buy high-quality farm inputs with clear pricing and product details",o="Clean Architecture",n=null,m=t.s
return A.b([A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/subuu.png",p,n,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tunyat.subuu","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/subuu_logo.png",q,B.eE,A.b(["Flutter","Firebase","BLoC",o,"Jira","Agile","Scrum","CI/CD"],m),"SuBuu - \u1005\u102f\u1017\u1030\u1038"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/community.png",p,n,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tunyat.subuu.community","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/subuu_community_logo.png",q,B.eE,A.b(["Flutter","Firebase","BLoC",o],m),"SuBuu-Community"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/shop.png",p,n,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tunyat.subuu.shop","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/subuu_shop_logo.png",q,B.eE,A.b(["Flutter","Firebase","BLoC",o],m),"SuBuu-Shop"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/mm_nrc.png",n,"https://github.com/myatnoeaung-dev/mm_nrc","https://pub.dev/packages/mm_nrc","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/mm_nrc_logo.png","The mm_nrc is a Flutter package that provides an input form for Myanmar National Registration Card (NRC) numbers.",B.eE,A.b(["Dart","Flutter","Pub.dev","GitHub"],m),"mm_nrc"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/vocab_cover.png","360ed's Vocabulary Builder AR Application is an educational application that can improve their English vocabulary by learning with 4D pictures and learning games. It will contribute to visual, auditory, and English vocabulary enhancement.\n\u25ba Education\n\u2022 200+ words with images and audio to study vocabulary.\n\n\u25ba There are Vocabulary Learning Games in which one can play and learn vocabulary.\n\u2022 Spell the word\n\u2022 Find the pictures\n\u2022 Match the words with images\n\u2022 Choose the correct words\n\n\u2727 AR\u2727\n1. Press the AR icon\n2. Scan the cards with the phone within [15cm - 30cm] for 3D models\n3. Press the \u2018Speaker\u2019 icon to hear correct pronunciation 4. Press the \u2018Camera\u2019 icon to take a picture with 3D models\n\n\u2726 FEATURES \u2726\n\u2727 Interactive 3D models with realistic textures\n\u2727 Tap the 3D models for their animations!\n\u2727 Rotate and zoom the models to explore furthermore\n\u2727 Offline use once the app is activated\n\u2727 Listen and practice correct pronunciation\n\u2727 Practise vocabulary in the \u201cLearn and Play\u201d section\n\n\u2726 Benefits to Learning \u2726\n\u2727 Helps visualize the world around us\n\u2727 Helps to learn the English vocabulary\n\u2727 Teaches correct pronunciation and usage in a sentence\n\u2727 Encourages inquiry and self-learning\n\n\u2726 How to Use \u2726\n\u2727 App Activation\n\u2727 1. Download the app\n2. Scan the QR Code to activate the app\n\n\u2726 About us, \u2726\n360ed is an EdTech social enterprise that was incubated at NASA Research Park in Silicon Valley in 2016. We leverage virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR) technology and other emerging technologies to bring scalable, immediate, and exponential impacts in transforming national education and beyond.\n\n360ed\u2019s products are on market in Myanmar, and rolling out to Singapore, Indonesia, Japan, and throughout Southeast Asia enhancing students\u2019 learning with tools for teachers and students, designed for the classroom, lab, and self-study.",n,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.threesixtyed.vocab","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/vocvab_logo.png","An AR-powered educational app that helps learners expand their English vocabulary through interactive 3D models, audio, and learning games across 12 themed categories.",B.eE,A.b(["Unity","C#","AR","Vuforia"],m),"Vocabulary Builder AR"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/aliveway.png",n,n,"https://apkpure.com/aliveway-myanmar/com.alivewaymyanmar.aliveway","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/aliveway_logo.png","Alive Way Myanmar is an agricultural support app developed by Alive Way Myanmar Company ",B.hk,A.b(["Flutter","Firebase","Bloc","MVVM","Dio"],m),"AliveWay Myanmar"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/sta.png","\ud83d\udcf1 Project Overview\n\nSTA Music is a native Android music application designed as an online music store and streaming platform featuring exclusive song listings by SOE THU AUNG. The app allows users to browse, stream, and purchase or access music online, while also supporting offline playback for downloaded songs.\n\nThe project combines online music browsing with offline listening capability, providing users with a flexible and seamless music experience.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Project Goals\nBuild a dedicated music store for SOE THU AUNG\u2019s song collection\nEnable users to stream music online with smooth performance\nProvide offline access for downloaded tracks\nDeliver a simple, modern, and user-friendly interface\nEnsure fast navigation and reliable playback experience\n\u2699\ufe0f Key Features\n\ud83c\udfa7 Online Music Streaming \u2013 Stream songs directly from the server\n\ud83d\uded2 Music Store Listing \u2013 Browse curated song collections (SOE THU AUNG)\n\ud83d\udce5 Offline Support \u2013 Download songs for offline listening\n\ud83d\udcc2 Organized Library \u2013 View songs by album, playlist, or category\n\ud83d\udd0a Background Playback \u2013 Continue music while using other apps\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Notification Controls \u2013 Play, pause, skip from notification panel\n\ud83d\udd0e Search & Discovery \u2013 Quickly find songs in the catalog\n\u2764\ufe0f Favorites System \u2013 Save preferred songs for easy access\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Tech Stack\nLanguage: Kotlin / Java\nArchitecture: MVVM / Clean architecture (if used)\nMedia Playback: ExoPlayer / MediaPlayer API\nNetworking: Retrofit / OkHttp (for online streaming)\nStorage: Room / Local cache / File storage (for offline songs)\nUI: RecyclerView, ViewBinding / DataBinding\nBackground Service: Foreground service for music playback",n,"https://apkpure.com/sta-music/com.tech.mymusicapp","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/sta.png","STA Music is a native Android music player with offline support, background playback, and organized local music browsing.",B.hk,A.b(["Android","Kotlin","Java","MVVM","Room","Exoplayer"],m),"STA Music \u2013 Native Android Music Player App"),A.pt("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/cover/ufl.png",n,n,"https://ufl7.com","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myatnoeaung-dev/myatnoeaung-dev.github.io/refs/heads/main/do_not_delete/logo/ufl7_logo.png","A modern social media platform with real-time features and beautiful UI.",B.hk,A.b(["Flutter","flutter_bloc","Web","Node.js"],m),"Ultimate Football League")],A.ak("B<ty>"))})
